{
  "title": "Vibrant Light Filipino Vegetable Pinakbet",
  "description": "A fatty and light Filipino dish featuring muscovado sugar, perfect for a hangover cure, made with sous-vide and FODMAP-friendly ingredients in a traditional pinakbet form, cooked in a Dutch-oven vessel.",
  "cuisine": "Filipino",
