  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the sous-vide machine to 180 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a Dutch-oven, heat the vegetable oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced bitter melon, eggplant, okra, and string beans, and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped tomato, fish sauce, muscovado sugar, and salt, and stir well.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a sous-vide bag and seal.",
    "Cook the mixture in the sous-vide machine for 30 minutes.",
    "Remove the bag from the machine and let it cool.",
    "Serve the pinakbet hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
  ],
